   "title": "Lake Harriet Buckthorn Slaying",
   "description": "<p><strong>Help clear buckthorn around Lake Harriet!</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Dates:</strong> Tuesdays and Thursdays 9-11am, May-September</p>\n<p><strong>Location:</strong> West side of Lake Harriet, between West 42nd and West 44th</p>\n<p><strong>Supplies:</strong> Bring your own water bottle, safety glasses, work gloves, and wear a long sleeve shirt and long pants. We will supply training and tools. If you prefer to bring your own tools (loppers, hand saws, and pruners are permitted) please mark them with your name.</p>\n<p><strong>Host:</strong> Lake Harriet Environmental Committee</p>\n<p><strong>Email Jim Nicholas to get involved <a href=\"mailto:jnicholas5329@gmail.com\">jnicholas5329@gmail.com</a></strong></p>",
