   "title": "Rose Garden Volunteering",
   "description": "<p><strong>Calling all rose lovers! Join the Deadheaders and develop skills while supporting care of the historic rose garden. Each gardening day will focus on a different topic related to the seasonal maintenance of Lyndale Park Rose Garden.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Dates:</strong> 1st and 3rd Saturday &amp; select Thursdays, May-October, 9-11am</p>\n<p><strong>Location:</strong> Lyndale Park Rose Garden<br />\nMeet near the Heffelfinger fountain</p>\n<p><strong>Supplies:</strong> Gloves, tools and parking passes will be provided</p>\n<p><strong>Weather:</strong> We work in light rain but will suspend or cancel work in severe weather</p>\n<p>NO EXPERIENCE NECESSARY &#8211; ALL ARE WELCOME!</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.signupgenius.com/go/60B0F48ADA928A2F58-60446456-rose\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Sign-up here</a></p>",
