   "title": "Minnehaha Park Invasive Plant Management",
   "description": "<p><strong>Join us for buckthorn removal (and other restoration activities) in Minnehaha Regional Park!</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Dates:</strong> Saturdays 10-noon, through October</p>\n<p><strong>Location:</strong> Meet at 4749 46th Ave S, parking lot. Wabun Park Maintenance Facility.</p>\n<p><strong>Supplies:</strong> Tools and instruction provided. Bring a water bottle, gloves, close-toed shoes, long pants, and clothes that can get dirty.</p>\n<p><strong>Host:</strong> Friends of Minnehaha Park</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.friendsofminnehahapark.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Learn more here</a>.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100092254982352\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Updates will be posted to Facebook</a>.</p>",
